  "title": "Barricade at the Crossroads",
  "introduction": "At the hall on the edge of town, Lysa asks you to bring back the cellar route register before raiders close the short passage. Neri is still in the cellar. You may help, refuse the errand, or leave town; the long lane remains open if you return late. In the square, the market cart can brace the short passage toward the hall; the cellar remains open and the back lane opens if the raiders take the short way.",
  "objective": "Choose whether to help Lysa. If you do, copy the cellar route register and report it at the hall; the long lane permits a late report. You may also refuse or leave town without claiming the errand was done.",
